[SIZE=5][B]★ Version History[/B][/SIZE]

[SIZE=4][B]What's New 1.0.0.3[/B][/SIZE]
[LIST]
[*][B]Merge directions[/B] in the lines list: the two routes of a line (there and back) are one line; highlight the whole line or a single direction. Circular lines show clockwise / anticlockwise.
[*][B]Station window by direction[/B]: vehicles at the station and on their way, split by line and direction.
[*]The first and last station of every route and its circular state are read from MTR.
[/LIST]

[SIZE=4][B]What's New 1.0.0.2[/B][/SIZE]
[LIST]
[*][B]Live web map[/B]: MTR rails with curves in the colours of your lines, platforms, depot sidings, station areas, depots and smoothly moving vehicles (trains, boats, cable cars, airplanes).
[*][B]Lines list[/B] with highlighting, [B]vehicle list[/B] with search and "follow", [B]station window[/B] with lines, vehicles at the station and vehicles heading there.
[*][B]Transport type switches[/B] on the website.
[*]Data is read on MTR's own simulation thread — nothing runs on the Minecraft server thread.
[*][B]Dynmap is optional[/B]; markers unchanged; sync interval and icons configurable.
[*][B]English / Russian[/B] localization.
[*]/mtrmap, /mtrstations, /mtrroutes; stations.txt / routes.txt; station and route blacklists.
[*]Existing config.yml files are upgraded automatically; worlds mappings are kept.
[*]Quieter console.
[/LIST]

[SIZE=4][B]What's New 1.0.0.1[/B][/SIZE]
[LIST]
[*]Fixed Dynmap markers remaining after MTR stations or depots were removed; automatic cleanup of station and depot markers.
[*]Automatic world and dimension detection, with optional world mappings in config.yml.
[*]Automatic Y coordinate restoration when determining the surface location.
[/LIST]

[SIZE=4][B]What's New 1.0.0.0[/B][/SIZE]
[LIST]
[*]First release: MTR stations and depots on Dynmap.
